ISO-10303-21;
/* Gn162: degree-3 B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS with 6 poles; interior knot at 0.5 has multiplicity 4 = degree+1 (overclamped); creates C(-1) geometric discontinuity at t=0.5 (breakpoint); knot removal must repair; curve splits into two independent cubic segments; EDGE_CURVE on this curve — loads as shape(1) */
